@prefix ds: <https://ds.canonical.com/>.
@prefix anatomy: <https://anatomy.canonical.com/>.
@prefix dt: <https://dt.canonical.com/>.

ds:global.component.tooltip a ds:Component;
    ds:name "Tooltip";
    ds:summary "A tooltip provides brief, contextual information, that appears on hover or focus. It is used to clarify an unfamiliar icon/control, explain truncated/abbreviated content, or to add context without interrupting user flow. Tooltips should be short, optional, and non-critical. If the information is vital or requires interaction, use a different pattern.\n\nRelated to [TooltipWrapper](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-69TNyYt7M9) and [TooltipData](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-Y1ha3zI_b_).";
    ds:anatomyDsl "---\n# One tree serves both types: Standard has text, an optional icon and an\n# optional arrow; Dense has compact text only. Where they differ is noted at the\n# property. An inverted tooltip is made by switching the variable mode of the\n# instance, so the colours are bound directly and not through surface channels.\nnode:\n  uri: global.component.tooltip\n  styles:\n    # The arrow is positioned against this box, so it stays the positioning\n    # context.\n    layout.type: inline-block\n    layout.position: fixed\n    # Stays visible so the arrow, which sits outside the box, is not clipped.\n    layout.overflow: visible\n    appearance.background: color.background.container\n    typography.color: color.text\n    appearance.border.color: color.border.muted\n    appearance.border.style: solid\n    appearance.border.width: dimension.stroke.thickness.medium\n    appearance.radius: dimension.radius.small\n    # Standard uses text-secondary and Dense uses text-tertiary; the tree\n    # carries only the Standard value.\n    typography.font: typography.text.secondary\n    typography.align: left\n    typography.decoration: initial\n    interaction.pointerEvents: auto\n    size.max.width: 284px\n    spacing.external.block.end: 0\n    spacing.external.inline.end: 0\n    # Standard padding. Dense uses dimension.100 inline and dimension.050 block,\n    # which the tree cannot carry per type.\n    spacing.internal.inline.start: dimension.200\n    spacing.internal.inline.end: dimension.200\n    spacing.internal.block.start: dimension.100\n    spacing.internal.block.end: dimension.100\n    # Closed by default. Opening is a display change, not an interaction state,\n    # so no @state marker applies.\n    appearance.opacity: 0\n    appearance.visibility: hidden\n    motion.property: \"opacity, visibility\"\n    # No motion symbol is declared, so the duration is written as a literal.\n    motion.duration: 0.1s\n    motion.easing: ease-in-out\n  edges:\n    - node:\n        role: content row\n        styles:\n          layout.type: flex\n          layout.align: flex-start\n          spacing.gap: dimension.100\n        edges:\n          - node:\n              role: icon\n              styles:\n                layout.type: inline-flex\n                layout.flex.grow: 0\n                layout.flex.shrink: 0\n                layout.flex.basis: auto\n                size.inline: dimension.200\n                spacing.internal.block.start: dimension.025\n            relation:\n              cardinality: \"0..1\"\n              slotName: icon\n          - node:\n              role: text\n              styles:\n                typography.whiteSpace: pre-wrap\n            relation:\n              cardinality: \"1\"\n              slotName: default\n      relation:\n        cardinality: \"1\"\n        slotName: default\n    - node:\n        role: arrow\n        styles:\n          layout.position: absolute\n          # Which side it points from follows the Arrow variant, so its offsets\n          # are not bound, and the DSL has no triangle shape.\n          size.width: dimension.175\n          size.height: dimension.100\n          appearance.background: color.background.container\n          appearance.border.color: color.border.muted\n          appearance.border.style: solid\n          appearance.border.width: dimension.stroke.thickness.medium\n      relation:\n        # The component draws the arrow; no caller fills it, so it carries no\n        # slot name. Dense draws none.\n        cardinality: \"0..1\"";
    ds:anatomyClassic "## Anatomy\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/WGHcOmGMEUF9hMAEoRafL8/%F0%9F%93%95-Pragma---documentation-visuals?node-id=9415-1616&t=pA5l7Omuxa3ATwVS-1\n\n1. **Container**\n\nHolds the tooltip content and sets it apart from the page.\n\n1. **Text**\n\nShort supplementary copy that explains or clarifies the trigger.\n\n1. **Icon (optional)**\n\nAdds a visual cue to the text. Do not use when the trigger is itself an icon.\n\n1. **Arrow**\n\nPoints from the tooltip to its trigger. Not used in [Tooltip+Dense](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-PFE_wK_bWT) variant.\n\n## Styling\n\n**Layout and spacing**\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/WGHcOmGMEUF9hMAEoRafL8/%F0%9F%93%95-Pragma---documentation-visuals?node-id=9416-2001&t=pA5l7Omuxa3ATwVS-1\n\n**Colors**\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/WGHcOmGMEUF9hMAEoRafL8/%F0%9F%93%95-Pragma---documentation-visuals?node-id=9416-2060&t=pA5l7Omuxa3ATwVS-1\n\n**Typography**\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/WGHcOmGMEUF9hMAEoRafL8/%F0%9F%93%95-Pragma---documentation-visuals?node-id=9416-2079&t=pA5l7Omuxa3ATwVS-1\n\n**Overflow**\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/WGHcOmGMEUF9hMAEoRafL8/%F0%9F%93%95-Pragma---documentation-visuals?node-id=9416-2085&t=pA5l7Omuxa3ATwVS-1";
    ds:usage "## When to use\n\n- When a default tooltip is required for controls or icons\n- When an unfamiliar UI element, label, or action requires clarification\n- When content can be expressed as a single-line explanation or short phrase\n- When sufficient space is available for comfortable reading near the trigger\n- When supplementary information does not need to persist\n\n## When not to use\n\n- When the layout is dense and the tooltip may overlap important UI\n  - Incorrect: A standard tooltip is used inside a compact data table where it obscures adjacent values\n  - Remediation: Use a [Tooltip+Dense](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-PFE_wK_bWT) to reduce visual footprint\n- When content consists of abbreviations or truncated values\n  - Incorrect: A standard tooltip is used to expand shortened labels in a toolbar\n  - Remediation: Use a [Tooltip+Dense](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-PFE_wK_bWT) designed for compact label expansion\n- When content is structured or contains multiple elements\n  - Incorrect: A tooltip contains a table, multiple text blocks, and icons\n  - Remediation: Use [TooltipWrapper](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-69TNyYt7M9)  to support structured content\n- When used for data visualisation\n  - Incorrect: A standard tooltip is used to display chart data values\n  - Remediation: Use [TooltipData](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-Y1ha3zI_b_) for label–value pairs and data inspection\n- When content is interactive or requires persistence\n  - Incorrect: A tooltip contains clickable actions or inputs\n  - Remediation: Use [Popover](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-i-62pvfoOF) or another persistent surface\n- When the element is already clearly labelled or self-explanatory.\n\n**In essence:**\n\nWhen in doubt, start with standard [Tooltip](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-ONb9LwkGvW). Move to its [Tooltip+Dense](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-PFE_wK_bWT) variant for space constraints; [TooltipWrapper](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-69TNyYt7M9) for structured content and complex hierarchies; [TooltipData](https://docs.superhuman.com/d/_dNyzE_TLZDh#_tugrid-20dWwIHYhx/_rui-Y1ha3zI_b_) for data visualization.";
    ds:guidelines "**Important note on implementation:**\n\nAnimation values below are intended for [Framer Motion](https://motion.dev/), now just “Motion”.\n\n### **For all variants**\n\n- Show with a 400 ms delay after hover or focus\n- Hide with a 400 ms delay after the pointer leaves\n- Cancel display if the pointer exits before the show delay completes\n- If the pointer moves directly from one tooltip trigger to another, show the new tooltip immediately and skip the previous tooltip’s exit animation\n\n### **Transition**\n\n- **Type**: spring\n- **Duration**: 0.4 s\n- **Bounce**: 0.2\n- **Delay**: 0 s\n\n### Reduced motion\n\n- Fade in and out with no scale or movement, keeping the same delays.\n- The Data tooltip snaps to the pointer instead of easing.\n\n### CSS fallback\n\n- Opacity 0 to 1 and scale 0.96 to 1 over 400 ms, cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), transform origin at the arrow.\n\n### Interactions\n\n- Opens on hover and on keyboard focus, never on click.\n- Closes when the pointer or focus leaves, on Escape, and when another tooltip opens.\n- Only one tooltip is open at a time.\n- The pointer can move onto the tooltip without it closing.\n- Default position is centred on the trigger with an 8 px offset.\n\n### Positioning and responsive\n\n- Positioned relative to its trigger. Flips to the opposite side when there isn't enough room and never overflows the viewport.\n- Collision padding is 24 px for Standard and Wrapper, and 16 px for Dense.\n- Tooltips don't appear on touch devices, so essential information must be available another way.\n\n### Overflow\n\n- Text wraps at the max width (284 px).\n\n### Typography\n\n- Standard: typography-text-secondary-$root (14/20).\n- Dense: typography-text-tertiary-$root (12/16).\n- Helper headings and Strong key-value pairs: typography-text-secondary-$bold. Tooltip table headers: typography-text-tertiary-$bold.\n- Values use tabular figures in code.\n\n### Keyboard support\n\n- Tab or Shift+Tab to a trigger opens its tooltip.\n- Escape closes it without moving focus.\n- No other keys are handled.\n\n### Focus\n\n- Tooltips aren't focusable and aren't part of the tab order. They contain no interactive content.\n- When the trigger receives keyboard focus, the tooltip opens after the same delay as hover.\n- Disabled triggers don't receive focus, so a disabled control that needs an explanation should be wrapped in a focusable element.\n\n### ARIA\n\n- The tooltip element has role=\"tooltip\".\n- When it adds supplementary information, the trigger references it with aria-describedby.\n- When it's the only label (icon-only triggers), the trigger uses aria-labelledby or an aria-label with the same text.\n- Decorative icons inside the tooltip are hidden from assistive technology.\n\n### References\n\n- [WAI-ARIA tooltip pattern](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/tooltip/): role=\"tooltip\", aria-describedby, open on focus, Escape to dismiss.\n- [WCAG 1.4.13](https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/Understanding/content-on-hover-or-focus.html): dismissable, hoverable and persistent content on hover or focus.\n- [Carbon tooltip](https://carbondesignsystem.com/components/tooltip/usage/): 8/16 padding, 288 px max width, caret and offset. Closest sizing reference.\n- [Material 3](https://m3.material.io/components/tooltips/guidelines): plain vs rich tooltips, inverted surface by default, no caret.\n- [Grafana data tooltips](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/panels-visualizations/configure-tooltips/): cursor-follow behaviour and compact 24 px rows for series.\n\n";
    ds:tier ds:global;
    ds:documentationStage ds:tag.needsfulldocumentation;
    ds:hasProperty [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "***All variants***";
        ds:optional "false"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Type";
        ds:summary "Selects the tooltip variant";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Dense\nWrapper\nData";
        ds:defaultValue "Standard"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Surrounding UI theme";
        ds:summary "Sets tooltip theme based on surrounding UI context";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Dark";
        ds:defaultValue "Paper"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "***Standard tooltip***";
        ds:optional "false"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Icon";
        ds:summary "Shows an optional icon inside the tooltip";
        ds:optional "true";
        ds:propertyType "boolean";
        ds:constraints "No";
        ds:defaultValue "Yes"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Arrow";
        ds:summary "Sets arrow orientation";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Right\nUp\nDown";
        ds:defaultValue "Left"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Max width";
        ds:summary "Maximum width of tooltip container";
        ds:optional "true";
        ds:propertyType "number";
        ds:constraints "px";
        ds:defaultValue "284"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "***Dense tooltip***";
        ds:optional "false"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Position";
        ds:summary "Preferred placement relative to trigger";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Right\nUp\nDown";
        ds:defaultValue "Auto"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Max width";
        ds:summary "Maximum width of tooltip container";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "number";
        ds:constraints "px";
        ds:defaultValue "284"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "***Wrapper tooltip***";
        ds:optional "false"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "*Wrapper container*";
        ds:optional "false"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Position";
        ds:summary "Preferred placement relative to trigger";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Right\nUp\nDown";
        ds:defaultValue "Auto"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Max width";
        ds:summary "Optional width override for wrapper tooltip";
        ds:optional "true";
        ds:propertyType "number";
        ds:constraints "px";
        ds:defaultValue "284"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "*Wrapper item*";
        ds:optional "false"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Wrapper item (instance swap)";
        ds:summary "Selects which content block appears in this wrapper row";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "element";
        ds:constraints "Image\nCTA\nTable\nChart legend\nKVP";
        ds:defaultValue "none"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "*Key-value pair* (when selected as wrapper item)";
        ds:optional "false"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Value structure";
        ds:summary "Whether value is single or multi-entry";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Multi";
        ds:defaultValue "Single"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Value layout";
        ds:summary "How value is arranged visually";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Stacked";
        ds:defaultValue "Inline"
    ], [
        a ds:Property;
        ds:name "Layout";
        ds:summary "Layout control. Not for users.";
        ds:optional "false";
        ds:propertyType "choice";
        ds:constraints "Vertical";
        ds:defaultValue "Horizontal"
    ];
    ds:changeLog [
        a ds:ChangeLogEntry;
        ds:timestamp "2026-04-17T00:00:00.000+02:00";
        ds:changeType "decision"
    ], [
        a ds:ChangeLogEntry;
        ds:timestamp "2026-05-12T00:00:00.000+02:00";
        ds:changeType "change"
    ];
    ds:specializedBy ds:global.component.tooltip_data;
    ds:hasVariant ds:global.variant.tooltip_dense;
    ds:hasTokenBinding [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "appearance.background";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:color.background.container
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "typography.color";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:color.text
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "appearance.border.color";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:color.border.muted
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "appearance.border.width";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.stroke.thickness.medium
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "appearance.radius";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.radius.small
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "typography.font";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:typography.text.secondary
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "spacing.internal.inline.start";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.200
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "spacing.internal.inline.end";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.200
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "spacing.internal.block.start";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.100
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root";
        anatomy:styleKey "spacing.internal.block.end";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.100
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/content row";
        anatomy:styleKey "spacing.gap";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.100
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/content row/icon";
        anatomy:styleKey "size.inline";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.200
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/content row/icon";
        anatomy:styleKey "spacing.internal.block.start";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.025
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/arrow";
        anatomy:styleKey "size.width";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.175
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/arrow";
        anatomy:styleKey "size.height";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.100
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/arrow";
        anatomy:styleKey "appearance.background";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:color.background.container
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/arrow";
        anatomy:styleKey "appearance.border.color";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:color.border.muted
    ], [
        a ds:TokenBinding;
        ds:viaBlock ds:global.component.tooltip;
        ds:node "$root/arrow";
        anatomy:styleKey "appearance.border.width";
        anatomy:styleState "default";
        ds:rank 1;
        ds:consumesSymbol dt:dimension.stroke.thickness.medium
    ].
